    "A heritage walk needs a rest break too. The cafe 33 offers Cafe in bed according to the local recommendation. Use the booking link in this record before arriving, and confirm the time, price and conditions with the café. The local information warns that arriving without a booking may cost extra. Plan your next stop after a proper rest.",
