    "At XOFA, today’s Óc Eo story takes the form of a drink. Locally recommended Phù Nam rice milk is inspired by Óc Eo culture, with an indicative price from twenty-five thousand đồng. It is a contemporary creation, not a documented ancient recipe. Ask about the current price and ingredients, especially any allergens, then share the story alongside your photo.",
