    "For a meal break, ask about bánh xèo opposite Út Mập guesthouse. This local landmark does not confirm a fixed stall or opening hours. Check portions, prices and ingredients. Rather than assigning the dish an ancient origin, listen to how its maker prepares it today. Those conversations are part of living culture too.",
