    "For a snack break, ask about pounded papaya around Óc Eo lake. This is an area-based tip, so confirm the actual stall. Mention spice preferences and allergies before preparation. Rest somewhere appropriate, keep the shared space clean, and add your favourite flavour to your own story of Óc Eo.",
