    "A market offers a glimpse of everyday life. Óc Eo Market appears in a public listing, but the app has not checked its hours or individual stalls. Ask locals when to visit and keep passages clear. Seek permission before photographing sellers. Not every product is an inherited speciality; a thoughtful question often starts the better story.",
